		{"id":"464090889985e375","type":"text","text":"ArrayList ==转== 线程安全：\n1. 使用 synchronizedList 方法将 ArrayList 包装\n2. 使用 CopyOnWriteArrayList类代替\n3. 使用 vector 类替代","x":94,"y":-480,"width":406,"height":147},
		{"id":"a28618f68d08d7a9","x":-97,"y":-800,"width":250,"height":147,"type":"text","text":"ArrayList非线程安全体现：\n1. 部分值为null\n2. 索引越界异常\n3. size与add数量不符"},
